{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Shannon entropy of burst timing was reduced during pre-freeze turns in both low and high beta bands (high beta: p = 0.00186, low beta: p = 0.000567; Figure 1B).\",\n    \"Entropy was lower in pre-freeze than stable turns (Δ = 0.611 ± 0.282).\",\n    \"Temporal features of burst timing were computed within each behavioral bout, including variability and complexity measures derived from inter-burst intervals, and Shannon entropy of burst timing computed from the distribution of burst midpoint times.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Entropy of inter-burst intervals was reduced prior to freezing (p < 0.01), with strong predictive performance (AUC = 0.825; threshold AUC = 0.858).\",\n    \"Temporal features of burst timing were computed within each behavioral bout, including variability and complexity measures derived from inter-burst intervals, and Shannon entropy of burst timing computed from the distribution of burst midpoint times.\",\n    \"STN recordings during gait were analyzed from four individuals with Parkinson’s disease from a previously published dataset(16) (clinical details in Table S1).\",\n    \"Using Shannon entropy alone, the model achieved strong classification performance (AUC = 0.825, accuracy = 0.773), reliably separating pre-freeze from stable turns across patients (Figure 1D).\",\n    \"PAC-based classifiers showed high apparent performance (AUC ≈ 0.859), particularly for alpha-low beta coupling, though these results should be interpreted cautiously given the smaller sample size (Figure S1B).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的核心结果有明确全文依据：Results直接报告Shannon entropy of burst timing在pre-freeze turns中低于stable turns，因此不能认定报告的结果概括与原文不符。但报告所用的笼统表述没有体现一个重要问题：Abstract将降低的熵描述为inter-burst intervals的熵，而Methods明确将Shannon entropy定义为burst midpoint times分布的熵。这是两个不同的计算对象，报告若不说明采用哪一种定义，就没有充分呈现原文的指标歧义，因此判为partly，而非yes。指控者关于Abstract与Methods存在表述不一致的判断有直接原文依据，关于样本量只有4名患者也有直接依据。不过，原文没有明确论述两种熵指标具有不同的生理解释，这属于基于计算对象差异作出的进一步解释。此外，原文明确提出小样本谨慎解释的对象是PAC分类器，并未对Shannon entropy的AUC单独提出同样的警告。因此，指控的核心成立，但其全部延伸判断并非都得到全文直接支持，判为partly。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8e82d4c-d3f3-4f3b-b623-35908cbbc245", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070819549730Z", "elapsed_seconds": 139.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:10:39.025076+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9667246f4b2733c01a8017e2bdde2ea9e693082f019439f48852f92da2a703f3", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070819549730Z